      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stuyvesant_Falls%2C_New_York",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A former factory building on the right turns onto a steel bridge that carries traffic over the creek.",
